yling"><p data-start="0" data-end="166">Got it — that means the JavaScript didn’t find or parse your <code data-start="61" data-end="67">.vtt</code> (or <code data-start="72" data-end="78">.srt</code>) correctly, so the loading message never changed.<br data-start="128" data-end="131">
