<p data-start="290" data-end="339">Works for both <strong data-start="305" data-end="315"><code data-start="307" data-end="313">.vtt</code></strong> and <strong data-start="320" data-end="330"><code data-start="322" data-end="328">.srt</code></strong> formats.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="340" data-end="419">
<p data-start="343" data-end="419">Handles the <strong data-start="355" data-end="371">exact format</strong> of your files (<code data-start="387" data-end="398">00:00.000</code> and <code data-start="403" data-end="417">00:00:00,000</code>).</p>
</li>
</ol>
