</span><span><span class="hljs-section">## <span class="hljs-strong">**2. The Unified Theory — EBSSC**</span></span></span><span>

</span><span><span class="hljs-section">### 2.1 The Cognitive Substrate: RSVP Fields</span></span><span>

| Field | Meaning |
|---|---|
| </span><span><span class="hljs-strong">**Φ (Scalar Potential)**</span></span><span> | Semantic density, value, visibility |
| </span><span><span class="hljs-strong">**v (Vector Flow)**</span></span><span> | Agency, intention, policy flux |
| </span><span><span class="hljs-strong">**S (Entropy Field)**</span></span><span> | Uncertainty, noise, disorder |

Cognition = dynamics on this field manifold.

---

</span><span><span class="hljs-section">### 2.2 Semantic Primitives: The Sphere</span></span><span>

A </span><span><span class="hljs-emphasis">*semantic sphere*</span></span><span> σ is:

| Property | Meaning |
