distinctions, audiences, dependencies, and usage patterns.</p>
<hr data-start="197" data-end="200">
<h1 data-start="202" data-end="234"><strong data-start="204" data-end="234">Flyxion Research Ecosystem</strong></h1>
<h3 data-start="235" data-end="301"><em data-start="239" data-end="301">A Coherence-First Substrate for Cognition, Knowledge, and AI</em></h3>
<p data-start="303" data-end="418">The Flyxion ecosystem is a family of theoretical and computational projects built around a single organizing claim:</p>
<blockquote data-start="420" data-end="570">
<p data-start="422" data-end="570"><strong data-start="422" data-end="570">Thought, meaning, and intelligence are physical processes that must obey entropy budgets, sparsity constraints, and representational invariants.</strong></p>
</blockquote>
<p data-start="572" data-end="781">From this principle arise new models of cognition, AI alignment, collective knowledge, and digital society—formalized mathematically, operationalized computationally, and evaluated via falsifiable predictions.</p>
<p data-start="783" data-end="816">This repository network contains:</p>
<ol data-start="818" data-end="1268">
<li data-start="818" data-end="852">
<p data-start="821" data-end="852"><strong data-start="821" data-end="845">A physics of meaning</strong> (RSVP)</p>
</li>
<li data-start="853" data-end="913">
<p data-start="856" data-end="913"><strong data-start="856" data-end="893">A calculus for structured thought</strong> (EBSSC + SpherePOP)</p>
</li>
<li data-start="914" data-end="987">
<p data-start="917" data-end="987"><strong data-start="917" data-end="961">A model of cognition as sparse inference</strong> (Policy Selection Theory)</p>
</li>
<li data-start="988" data-end="1053">
<p data-start="991" data-end="1053"><strong data-start="991" data-end="1031">A theory of alignment via invariants</strong> (Invariant Alignment)</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1054" data-end="1111">
<p data-start="1057" data-end="1111"><strong data-start="1057" data-end="1099">A platform design immune to extraction</strong> (PlenumHub)</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1112" data-end="1196">
<p data-start="1115" data-end="1196"><strong data-start="1115" data-end="1172">A theory of curriculum-driven representation learning</strong> (Platonic Intelligence)</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1197" data-end="1268">
<p data-start="1200" data-end="1268"><strong data-start="1200" data-end="1244">A theory of self as a critical attractor</strong> (Bound Policy Identity)</p>
</li>
</ol>
<hr data-start="1270" data-end="1273">
<h2 data-start="1275" data-end="1295"><strong data-start="1278" data-end="1295">Core Concepts</strong></h2>
<div class="_tableContainer_1rjym_1"><div tabindex="-1" class="group _tableWrapper_1rjym_13 flex w-fit flex-col-reverse"><table data-start="1297" data-end="2357" class="w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)"><thead data-start="1297" data-end="1318"><tr data-start="1297" data-end="1318"><th data-start="1297" data-end="1307" data-col-size="sm">Concept</th><th data-start="1307" data-end="1318" data-col-size="md">Meaning</th></tr></thead><tbody data-start="1329" data-end="2357"><tr data-start="1329" data-end="1469"><td data-start="1329" data-end="1376" data-col-size="sm"><strong data-start="1331" data-end="1375">RSVP (Relativistic Scalar–Vector Plenum)</strong></td><td data-start="1376" data-end="1469" data-col-size="md">A field theory of cognition with semantic potential (Φ), agency flow (v), and entropy (S)</td></tr><tr data-start="1470" data-end="1567"><td data-start="1470" data-end="1482" data-col-size="sm"><strong data-start="1472" data-end="1481">EBSSC</strong></td><td data-start="1482" data-end="1567" data-col-size="md">Entropy-Bounded Sparse Semantic Calculus: a formal system for thought and meaning</td></tr><tr data-start="1568" data-end="1654"><td data-start="1568" data-end="1590" data-col-size="sm"><strong data-start="1570" data-end="1589">Semantic Sphere</strong></td><td data-start="1590" data-end="1654" data-col-size="md">A typed, bounded unit of meaning with entropy and provenance</td></tr><tr data-start="1655" data-end="1760"><td data-start="1655" data-end="1671" data-col-size="sm"><strong data-start="1657" data-end="1670">SpherePOP</strong></td><td data-start="1671" data-end="1760" data-col-size="md">A physics-like calculus of concept interaction (merge, bind, collapse, rewrite, etc.)</td></tr><tr data-start="1761" data-end="1855"><td data-start="1761" data-end="1791" data-col-size="sm"><strong data-start="1763" data-end="1790">Sparse Policy Selection</strong></td><td data-start="1791" data-end="1855" data-col-size="md">Cognition modeled as L1-regularized free-energy optimization</td></tr><tr data-start="1856" data-end="1963"><td data-start="1856" data-end="1882" data-col-size="sm"><strong data-start="1858" data-end="1881">Invariant Alignment</strong></td><td data-start="1882" data-end="1963" data-col-size="md">AI alignment by making misalignment <em data-start="1920" data-end="1937">unrepresentable</em>, not merely discouraged</td></tr><tr data-start="1964" data-end="2059"><td data-start="1964" data-end="1988" data-col-size="sm"><strong data-start="1966" data-end="1987">Scalar Extraction</strong></td><td data-start="1988" data-end="2059" data-col-size="md">A field theory model of exploitative platforms (∇Φ·v &lt; 0, ∇S·v &gt; 0)</td></tr><tr data-start="2060" data-end="2166"><td data-start="2060" data-end="2090" data-col-size="sm"><strong data-start="2062" data-end="2089">Texture &amp; Time Crystals</strong></td><td data-start="2090" data-end="2166" data-col-size="md">Non-extractive knowledge incentives (coherence &amp; persistence currencies)</td></tr><tr data-start="2167" data-end="2259"><td data-start="2167" data-end="2188" data-col-size="sm"><strong data-start="2169" data-end="2187">Policy Binding</strong></td><td data-start="2188" data-end="2259" data-col-size="md">Mechanism of abstraction via interference among sparse policy atoms</td></tr><tr data-start="2260" data-end="2357"><td data-start="2260" data-end="2280" data-col-size="sm"><strong data-start="2262" data-end="2279">Critical Self</strong></td><td data-start="2280" data-end="2357" data-col-size="md">Identity as a stable, sparse, entropy-defying attractor at phase boundary</td></tr></tbody></table><div class="sticky h-0 select-none end-(--thread-content-margin) self-end"><div class="absolute end-0 flex items-end"><span class="" data-state="closed"><button aria-label="Copy table" class="hover:bg-token-bg-tertiary text-token-text-secondary my-1 rounded-sm p-1 transition-opacity group-[:not(:hover):not(:focus-within)]:pointer-events-none group-[:not(:hover