<h2 data-start="4742" data-end="4763"><strong data-start="4745" data-end="4763">Minimal Axioms</strong></h2>
<ol data-start="4765" data-end="5123">
<li data-start="4765" data-end="4801">
<p data-start="4768" data-end="4801"><strong data-start="4768" data-end="4801">Thought has an entropy budget</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="4802" data-end="4840">
<p data-start="4805" data-end="4840"><strong data-start="4805" data-end="4840">Coherence has a sparsity budget</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="4841" data-end="4882">
<p data-start="4844" data-end="4882"><strong data-start="4844" data-end="4882">Meaning is geometric, not symbolic</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="4883" data-end="4918">
<p data-start="4886" data-end="4918"><strong data-start="4886" data-end="4918">Understanding is compression</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="4919" data-end="4965">
<p data-start="4922" data-end="4965"><strong data-start="4922" data-end="4965">Intelligence is structure, not behavior</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="4966" data-end="5018">
<p data-start="4969" data-end="5018"><strong data-start="4969" data-end="5018">Alignment must be invariant, not incentivized</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="5019" data-end="5072">
<p data-start="5022" data-end="5072"><strong data-start="5022" data-end="5072">Platforms must conserve agency, not harvest it</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="5073" data-end="5123">
<p data-start="5076" data-end="5123"><strong data-start="5076" data-end="5123">The self is a phase-locked policy attractor</strong></p>
</li>
</ol>
