<hr data-start="7003" data-end="7006">
<h2 data-start="7008" data-end="7027"><strong data-start="7011" data-end="7027">Contributing</strong></h2>
<p data-start="7029" data-end="7080">We are not seeking feature requests—we are seeking:</p>
<ul data-start="7082" data-end="7252">
<li data-start="7082" data-end="7104">
<p data-start="7084" data-end="7104"><strong data-start="7084" data-end="7104">Invariant proofs</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="7105" data-end="7131">
<p data-start="7107" data-end="7131"><strong data-start="7107" data-end="7131">Sparsity experiments</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="7132" data-end="7168">
<p data-start="7134" data-end="7168"><strong data-start="7134" data-end="7168">Topology-preserving optimizers</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="7169" data-end="7207">
<p data-start="7171" data-end="7207"><strong data-start="7171" data-end="7207">Entropy-audited knowledge graphs</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="7208" data-end="7252">
<p data-start="7210" data-end="7252"><strong data-start="7210" data-end="7252">Consciousness criticality measurements</strong></p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="7254" data-end="7257">
<h2 data-start="7259" data-end="7273"><strong data-start="7262" data-end="7273">License</strong></h2>
<p data-start="7275" data-end="7477">This work is conceptual, foundational, and intended as public infrastructure for safe cognition and coordination. Use it to build systems that <strong data-start="7418" data-end="7477">reduce entropy, conserve agency, and resist extraction.</strong></p>
<hr data-start="7479" data-end="7482">
<p data-start="7484" data-end="7519">If you'd like, next I can generate:</p>
