yling"><p data-start="0" data-end="79">Got it — here is a <strong data-start="19" data-end="51">short, clean, neutral README</strong> with no mention of Flyxion:</p>
<hr data-start="81" data-end="84">
<h1 data-start="86" data-end="134">Cognitive Physics &amp; Coherent Knowledge Systems</h1>
<p data-start="136" data-end="323">This repository hosts a set of theoretical and practical frameworks for modeling <strong data-start="217" data-end="267">thought, meaning, AI, and collective knowledge</strong> as physical, structured, information-bounded processes.</p>
<p data-start="325" data-end="454">The core idea:<br data-start="339" data-end="342">
<strong data-start="342" data-end="454">Cognition and knowledge evolve under limits of entropy, sparsity, and coherence — not arbitrary computation.</strong></p>
<hr data-start="456" data-end="459">
<h2 data-start="461" data-end="478">Key Components</h2>
